        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5050LSHA, Hammered Lever with Modern Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Lever with Square Rose is a great way to add texture to a room. The L-Squared Hammered Lever with Square Rose is available in a wide array of modern finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Hammered Lever with Modern Square Rosette fits doors between 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with a 2-1/8 inch bore standard door preparation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSHA-specifications.gif?v=1704354603\" width=\"600\" height=\"145\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Hammered Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Hammered Door Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Hammered L-Squared Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSHA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Emtek Hammered Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hammered Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Hammered Lever with Square Rose is a great way to add texture to a room. The L-Squared Hammered Lever with Square Rose is available in a wide array of modern finishes. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The Hammered Lever with Modern Square Rosette fits doors between 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with a 2-1/8 inch bore standard door preparation.",
